OL,3,GNEWSAWhat is behind the success of dark
OL,4,Askies festival?
OL,5,
OL,6,FStargazers and astronomers are
OL,7,Fpreparing to enjoy a festival that
OL,8,Fcelebrates the beauty of the night sky.
OL,10,FThe annual Exmoor Dark Skies Festival
OL,11,Fis being held from 16 October to 1
OL,12,FNovember and this year is its 10th
OL,13,Fanniversary.
OL,15,FTaking in villages and towns
OL,16,Fsurrounding Exmoor National Park, the
OL,17,Fevent offers walks, talks and shows -
OL,18,Fputting the dark, clear, night sky into
OL,19,Ffull focus.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
